#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:63
msgid ""
"Numeric fds and `fs.promises.FileHandle` objects are thread-affine. A "
"captured fd is not registered in worker threads, and a captured `FileHandle` "
"is detached with `fd === -1`. For file-backed parallel work, capture path "
"strings and open the file inside the mapper."
msgstr ""
"Numerische fds und `fs.promises.FileHandle`-Objekte sind thread-affin. Ein "
"erfasster fd ist in Worker-Threads nicht registriert, und ein erfasstes "
"`FileHandle` ist mit `fd === -1` losgelöst. Für dateibasierte Parallelarbeit "
"erfassen Sie Pfad-Strings und öffnen die Datei innerhalb des Mappers."

#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:68
msgid "What Cannot Be Captured"
msgstr "Was nicht erfasst werden kann"

#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:70
msgid ""
"Mutable variables — variables that are reassigned anywhere in the enclosing "
"scope — are rejected at compile time:"
msgstr ""
"Veränderliche Variablen — Variablen, die irgendwo im umschließenden Scope "
"neu zugewiesen werden — werden zur Compile-Zeit zurückgewiesen:"

#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:72
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let total = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Cannot capture mutable variable 'total'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    total += item;   // Would be a data race\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let total = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Cannot capture mutable variable 'total'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    total += item;   // Would be a data race\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"

