#: src/ui/layout.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry provides layout containers that arrange child widgets using the "
"platform's native layout system. Every snippet below is excerpted from "
"[`docs/examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/"
"snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
"Perry stellt Layout-Container bereit, die Kind-Widgets mithilfe des nativen "
"Layout-Systems der Plattform anordnen. Jedes untenstehende Snippet stammt "
"aus [`docs/examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/"
"snippets.ts) — CI kompiliert und führt es bei jedem PR aus."

#: src/ui/layout.md:8
msgid ""
"Layout helpers are free functions: `widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, "
"`stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, "
"bottom,  right)`, etc. Stack constructors take a numeric spacing followed by "
"a child array; everything else (alignment, distribution, padding, sizing) is "
"applied post-construction via the free functions on the widget handle."
msgstr ""
"Layout-Helfer sind freie Funktionen: `widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, "
"`stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, "
"bottom,  right)`, etc. Stack Konstruktoren nehmen einen numerischen Abstand, "
"gefolgt von einem Child Array; alles andere (Ausrichtung, Verteilung, "
"Polsterung, Dimensionierung) wird nach der Konstruktion über die freien "
"Funktionen auf dem Widget-Handle angewendet."

#: src/ui/layout.md:14 src/platforms/watchos.md:141 src/platforms/android.md:34
#: src/platforms/linux.md:48 src/widgets/components.md:40
msgid "VStack"
msgstr "VStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:16
msgid "Arranges children vertically (top to bottom)."
msgstr "Ordnet Kinder vertikal an (oben nach unten)."

#: src/ui/layout.md:18
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:26
msgid ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — the first argument is the gap in points "
"between children."
msgstr ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — das erste Argument ist der Abstand in Punkten "
"zwischen den Kindern."

#: src/ui/layout.md:29 src/platforms/watchos.md:142 src/platforms/android.md:35
#: src/platforms/linux.md:49 src/widgets/components.md:49
msgid "HStack"
msgstr "HStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:31
msgid "Arranges children horizontally (left to right)."
msgstr "Ordnet Kinder horizontal an (links nach rechts)."

#: src/ui/layout.md:33
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"OK\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
