#: src/ui/canvas.md:3
msgid "The `Canvas` widget provides a 2D drawing surface for custom graphics."
msgstr ""
"Das `Canvas`-Widget bietet eine 2D-Zeichenfläche für benutzerdefinierte "
"Grafiken."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:5
msgid ""
"**Availability**: the `Canvas` handle and method-dispatch surface compile "
"and link on every backend, which was the scope closed by [\\#190](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/190). Full stateful 2D rasterization is "
"currently supported by the web backend only. Native backends have canvas "
"creation plus lower-level path/gradient/image infrastructure, but the HTML-"
"style state setters and drawing calls used in the examples below are still "
"classified `Unsupported` in `crates/perry-ui-test` and are stubbed or "
"incomplete. The snippets are compile-link verified by the doc-tests harness "
"against [`docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/blob/main/docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts); that proves API "
"routing, not visible native pixels. See that file for the full standalone "
"program."
msgstr ""
"**Verfügbarkeit**: die `Canvas` Handle und Methode-Dispatch Oberfläche "
"kompilieren und verbinden auf jedem Backend, das war der Bereich von [\\#190]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/190) geschlossen. Die vollständige "
"Stateful 2D Rasterisierung wird derzeit nur vom Web-Backend unterstützt. "
"Native Backends haben Canvas-Erstellung plus path/gradient/image-"
"Infrastruktur auf niedrigerer Ebene, aber die HTML-Stil Zustandssetter und "
"Zeichenaufrufe, die in den folgenden Beispielen verwendet werden, sind immer "
"noch `Unsupported` in `crates/perry-ui-test` klassifiziert und sind "
"stubbiert oder unvollständig. Die Schnipsel sind Compiler-Link, der durch "
"den doc-Tests-Harrow gegen [`docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts) "
"überprüft wird; das beweist API-Routing, nicht sichtbare native Pixel. Sehen "
"Sie die Datei für das komplette Standalone-Programm."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:18
msgid ""
"The drawing API is **method-based** on the canvas handle (matching the FFI "
"shape — `perry_ui_canvas_set_fill_color(handle, r, g, b, a)` etc.). Colors "
"are RGBA floats in `[0.0, 1.0]`."
msgstr ""
"Die Zeichen-API ist **methodenbasiert** auf dem Canvas-Handle (passend zur "
"FFI-Form — `perry_ui_canvas_set_fill_color(handle, r, g, b, a)` usw.). "
"Farben sind RGBA-Floats in `[0.0, 1.0]`."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:22
msgid "Creating a Canvas"
msgstr "Ein Canvas erstellen"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:30
msgid ""
"`Canvas(width, height)` creates a canvas widget; subsequent draw operations "
"are method calls on the returned handle."
msgstr ""
"`Canvas(width, height)` erstellt ein Canvas-Widget; anschließende "
"Zeichenoperationen sind Methodenaufrufe am zurückgegebenen Handle."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:33
msgid "Drawing Shapes"
msgstr "Formen zeichnen"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:35
msgid "Rectangles"
msgstr "Rechtecke"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:37
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"canvas.setFillColor(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)    // red\n"
"canvas.fillRect(10, 10, 100, 80)\n"
"\n"
"canvas.setStrokeColor(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)  // blue\n"
"canvas.setLineWidth(2)\n"
"canvas.strokeRect(150, 10, 100, 80)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"canvas.setFillColor(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)    // red\n"
"canvas.fillRect(10, 10, 100, 80)\n"
"\n"
"canvas.setStrokeColor(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)  // blue\n"
"canvas.setLineWidth(2)\n"
"canvas.strokeRect(150, 10, 100, 80)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:46
msgid "Lines"
msgstr "Linien"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:57
msgid "Circles and Arcs"
msgstr "Kreise und Bögen"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:59
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"canvas.setFillColor(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)\n"
"canvas.beginPath()\n"
"canvas.arc(200, 150, 50, 0, Math.PI * 2)  // x, y, radius, startAngle, "
"endAngle\n"
"canvas.fill()\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"canvas.setFillColor(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)\n"
"canvas.beginPath()\n"
"canvas.arc(200, 150, 50, 0, Math.PI * 2)  // x, y, radius, startAngle, "
"endAngle\n"
"canvas.fill()\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/canvas.md:68
msgid ""
