#: src/tui/widgets.md:3
msgid ""
"`perry/tui` ships ~10 widgets that cover the typical interactive-CLI "
"surface. All of them are factory functions returning a widget handle — pass "
"them to `Box` as children, or to `render(widget)` / `run(() => widget)` as "
"the root."
msgstr ""
"`perry/tui` enthält ~10 Widgets, die die typische interaktive-CLI-Oberfläche "
"abdecken. Alle sind Factory-Funktionen, die ein Widget-Handle zurückgeben — "
"übergeben Sie sie an `Box` als Kinder oder an `render(widget)` / `run(() => "
"widget)` als Root."

#: src/tui/widgets.md:5
msgid "`Box(opts?, children?)`"
msgstr "`Box(opts?, children?)`"

#: src/tui/widgets.md:7
msgid ""
"A flexbox container. Holds any number of children laid out by direction, "
"gap, padding, and alignment rules."
msgstr ""
"Ein Flexbox-Container. Hält beliebig viele Kinder, die nach Richtung, "
"Abstand, Padding und Ausrichtungsregeln angeordnet werden."

#: src/tui/widgets.md:9
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"// Bare children — vertical column by default.\n"
"Box([Text(\"first\"), Text(\"second\")]);\n"
"\n"
"// With style.\n"
"Box({ flexDirection: \"row\", gap: 2, padding: 1 }, [\n"
"    Text(\"left\"),\n"
"    Text(\"right\"),\n"
"]);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"// Bare children — vertical column by default.\n"
"Box([Text(\"first\"), Text(\"second\")]);\n"
"\n"
"// With style.\n"
"Box({ flexDirection: \"row\", gap: 2, padding: 1 }, [\n"
"    Text(\"left\"),\n"
"    Text(\"right\"),\n"
"]);\n"
"```"

