"Supported props: `backgroundColor`, `color`, `fontSize`, `fontWeight`, "
"`fontFamily`, `borderRadius`, `padding` (number or per-side object), "
"`opacity`, `hidden`, `borderColor` + `borderWidth` (combined as "
