"**Install DevEco Studio** + the OpenHarmony SDK from Huawei. Verified "
"working with DevEco Studio 6.0.2 + OpenHarmony 5.0+."
msgstr ""
"**Installieren Sie DevEco Studio** + das OpenHarmony-SDK von Huawei. "
