"`~/.ohos/config/` automatisch, fragt das Keystore-Passwort ab und speichert "
"die Konfiguration persistent in `~/.perry/config.toml`. Nachfolgende `perry "
"compile --target harmonyos`-Aufrufe signieren HAPs automatisch."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:85
msgid ""
"**Optional**: install `hdc` (HarmonyOS Device Connector) for emulator "
"interaction. It ships inside DevEco at `Contents/sdk/default/openharmony/"
"toolchains/hdc`."
msgstr ""
"**Optional**: installieren Sie `hdc` (HarmonyOS Device Connector) für "
"Emulator-Interaktion. Es wird in DevEco unter `Contents/sdk/default/"
"openharmony/toolchains/hdc` ausgeliefert."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:87
msgid "Compile + run workflow"
msgstr "Kompilieren + Ausführen-Workflow"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:89
msgid "Write a TypeScript program with `App({body: ...})`:"
msgstr "Schreiben Sie ein TypeScript-Programm mit `App({body: ...})`:"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:91
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// hi.ts\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, Button, showToast } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"let count = 0;\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"  title: \"Perry on HarmonyOS\",\n"
"  body: VStack([\n"
"    Text(\"Count: 0\", \"counter\"),\n"
"    Button(\"+\", () => {\n"
"      count++;\n"
"      setText(\"counter\", `Count: ${count}`);\n"
"    }),\n"
"    Button(\"Notify\", () => {\n"
"      showToast(`Counter is ${count}`);\n"
"    }),\n"
"  ]),\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// hi.ts\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, Button, showToast } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"let count = 0;\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"  title: \"Perry on HarmonyOS\",\n"
"  body: VStack([\n"
"    Text(\"Count: 0\", \"counter\"),\n"
"    Button(\"+\", () => {\n"
"      count++;\n"
"      setText(\"counter\", `Count: ${count}`);\n"
"    }),\n"
"    Button(\"Notify\", () => {\n"
"      showToast(`Counter is ${count}`);\n"
"    }),\n"
"  ]),\n"
"});\n"
"```"

