#: src/stdlib/http.md:211
msgid ""
"The `node:http` server FFIs and the Web Fetch `Headers` / `Request` / "
"`Response` constructors now link together (issues #589, #1652). For a "
"turnkey adapter, prefer [perry's Fastify binding](#fastify-server) with a "
"single catch-all route delegating to `app.fetch`."
msgstr ""
"Die `node:http`-Server-FFIs und die Web-Fetch-Konstruktoren `Headers` / "
"`Request` / `Response` sind nun miteinander verknüpft (Issues #589, #1652). "
"Für einen fertigen Adapter empfiehlt sich [Perrys Fastify-Binding](#fastify-"
"server) mit einer einzigen Catch-All-Route, die Aufrufe an `app.fetch` "
"delegiert."

#: src/stdlib/http.md:216
