#: src/container/networking.md:189
msgid ""
"[Volumes](./volumes.md) — companion concept: networks without volumes is "
"rare in production stacks."
msgstr ""
"[Volumes](./volumes.md) — verwandtes Konzept: Netzwerke ohne Volumes sind in "
