"`AVAudioUnitVarispeed` (Rate pro Voice)."

#: src/system/audio_module.md:134
msgid ""
"Same `AVAudioEngine` stack as iOS. Background audio requires the host app to "
"declare the audio background mode entitlement; foreground playback works out "
"of the box."
msgstr ""
"Derselbe `AVAudioEngine`-Stack wie iOS. Hintergrundaudio erfordert, dass die "
"Host-App das Audio-Background-Mode-Entitlement deklariert; "
"Vordergrundwiedergabe funktioniert ohne weitere Konfiguration."

#: src/system/audio_module.md:135
msgid "Web Audio API (`AudioContext` + `AudioBufferSourceNode` + `GainNode`)"
msgstr "Web Audio API (`AudioContext` + `AudioBufferSourceNode` + `GainNode`)"

