"as user input — it was a fifth GC env knob with no CI arm, and was deleted "
"under CLAUDE.md's GC knob kill policy."
msgstr ""
"Der native GC-Wurzeldruckbericht hat **Nein** Umgebungsbuchstabierung: "
"verwenden Sie `--statepoint-report[=json]`. Die `PERRY_STATEPOINT_REPORT`-"
