"CI runners typically cache `~/.cargo` across jobs, so the pre-fetch is free "
"on subsequent builds."
msgstr ""
"CI-Runner cachen `~/.cargo` typischerweise über Jobs hinweg, sodass der Pre-"
"Fetch bei nachfolgenden Builds kostenlos ist."

