#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:134
msgid ""
"Alternative to `[project]` with identical fields. Useful for organizational "
"clarity — `[app]` takes precedence over `[project]` when both are present:"
msgstr ""
"Alternative zu `[project]` mit identischen Feldern. Nützlich für "
"organisatorische Klarheit — `[app]` hat Vorrang vor `[project]`, wenn beide "
"vorhanden sind:"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:136
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:146
msgid ""
"When both exist, resolution order is: `[app]` field -> `[project]` field -> "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Wenn beide existieren, ist die Auflösungsreihenfolge: `[app]`-Feld -> "
"`[project]`-Feld -> Standard."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:148
