#: src/internals/rfc-rooting-by-construction.md:15
msgid ""
"Five instances of one bug in about a day. Each was found by a different "
"means, each took hours to localise, and each fix was two lines. The fixes "
"are not the cost; the _representability_ is. Today a lowering author can "
"write the wrong thing, and nothing between their keyboard and a crash five "
"GC cycles later objects."
msgstr ""
"Fünf Fälle von einem Bug in etwa einem Tag. Jeder wurde mit einem anderen "
